  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/fmWwWkZ.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/askYVd2.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/支援Minecraft版本-1.19 | 1.18 | 1.17 | 1.16-ecebe6?labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge\" width=\"386\" height=\"28\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/安裝端-僅用戶端-ecebe6?labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge\" width=\"210\" height=\"28\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/stylish-effects/files/all?filter-status=1&amp;filter-game-version=2020709689:7498\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/3yrSsw7\" width=\"320\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/puzzles-lib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/3jr9xQw\" width=\"215\" height=\"28\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/stylish-effects/files/all?filter-status=1&amp;filter-game-version=2020709689:7499\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/3nRXr4m\" width=\"325\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/30lZmFY\" width=\"208\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/puzzles-lib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/3jr9xQw\" width=\"215\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/forge-config-api-port-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/3clkhvn\" width=\"299\" height=\"28\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/askYVd2.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>📖 關於本模組：</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>時尚效果</strong>全面改造了狀態效果的顯示方式。它提供了多種顯示模式供您選擇，並有無數的設定選項，讓您能打造出夢想中的效果顯示介面。</span></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/askYVd2.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>📚 主要內容：</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">首先，原本簡陋的HUD效果顯示會被一個更時尚的版本取代，其中包含了效果計時器和當前效果等級。現在這個顯示介面也會在物品欄中使用，因為它更為緊湊，並且能在效果圖示開始重疊之前顯示更多效果。而且，這個新的物品欄顯示不再僅限於玩家物品欄，您現在可以在任何容器介面中看到自己的活躍效果！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">等等，既然狀態效果以小圖示的方式緊湊顯示，那您要如何得知這些效果的名稱呢？別擔心，我們加入了一個方便的懸浮提示功能。如果您還安裝了 <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/just-enough-effect-descriptions-jeed\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Just Enough Effect Descriptions</strong></span></a>（作者：<span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/mehvahdjukaar\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>MehVahdJukaar</strong></span></a>），這個提示資訊會變得更加實用。</span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">您偏好原版物品欄的狀態效果顯示，並希望保留它，甚至將它套用到HUD上嗎？完全沒問題！您可以選擇任何您想要的小工具模式，甚至也可以完全不顯示。除此之外，還有許多可設定的選項，例如效果顯示在螢幕的哪一側、行數和列數、自訂透明度、文字顏色、自訂螢幕位置，以及更多、更多的功能。</span></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/askYVd2.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>📷 圖片展示：</strong></span></p><table style=\"text-align:center\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/480/288/2022-07-23_22.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/480/290/2022-07-23_22.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>時尚效果實際運作，非常時尚</strong></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><strong>可選擇並設定多種效果渲染類型</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/480/291/2022-07-23_22.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/480/292/2022-07-23_22.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>緊湊的效果顯示取代了物品欄內的原版顯示</strong></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><strong>效果顯示會出現在所有容器中，而不僅僅是物品欄</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/480/293/2022-07-23_22.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/480/294/2022-07-23_22.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>當滑鼠懸停在效果圖示上時，會顯示實用的提示資訊</strong></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><strong>琳瑯滿目的設定選項，打造您專屬的效果顯示</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/480/295/2022-07-23_22.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>出色的JEI和REI相容性</strong></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/askYVd2.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>💡 常見問答：</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>問：在Forge上我該如何設定這個模組？</strong><br><strong>答：</strong>安裝我的 <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/config-menus-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Config Menus for Forge</strong></span></a> 模組，然後直接在遊戲內進行設定！</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>問：在Fabric上我該如何設定這個模組？</strong><br><strong>答：</strong>直接在遊戲內編輯設定檔的功能尚未實作。請在遊戲世界中執行 <code>/config showfile &lt;modid&gt;</code> 指令，並選擇 <code>CLIENT</code> 或 <code>SERVER</code>（取決於模組類型）。然後點擊聊天中出現的檔案名稱（以.toml結尾），即可在外部編輯器中手動編輯設定檔。儲存檔案後，遊戲設定會在幾秒鐘內自動重新載入，因此無需重新啟動遊戲。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>問：我可以在哪裡下載適用於Minecraft 1.19之前版本的Fabric版本模組？</strong><br><strong>答：</strong>較舊的版本可以在 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/stylish-effects-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>舊的專案頁面</strong></span></a> 找到。</span></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/askYVd2.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>🏆 致謝名單：</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">本模組的開發受到以下人士的幫助與啟發：</span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/deadzoke\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Deadzoke</strong></span></a> 啟發了效果持續時間的顯示方式，靈感來自其 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ignitehud\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Ignite HUD</span></a> 模組</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/dmitrylovin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Dmitrylovin</strong></span></a> 啟發了緊湊的效果等級顯示方式，靈感來自其 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/inventory-hud-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Inventory HUD+</span></a> 模組</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/mag_icus\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>mag_icus</strong></span></a> 啟發了緊湊的效果持續時間顯示方式，靈感來自其 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/status-effect-timer\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Status Effect Timer</span></a> 模組</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/snownee_\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Snownee</strong></span></a> 提供了一個小技巧來停用JEI預設的物品欄狀態效果處理，靈感來自其 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mini-effects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Mini Effects</span></a> 模組</span></li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/askYVd2.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/lunapixelstudios/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=CurseForge&amp;message=LunaPixelStudios&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"282\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://twitter.com/LunaPixelStudio\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/twitter/follow/LunaPixelStudio?label=Twitter&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=twitter&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"149\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/8ZmhaPPbjE\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/790272037578473512?label=Discord&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"220\" height=\"28\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/1MOyd2u.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"300\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Fuzs_&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"97\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Fuzss&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"97\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC2l26SuCmCNSCPefpfbCX7Q\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Fuzs&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=youtube&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"89\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://twitter.com/Fusseel\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=@Fusseel&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=twitter&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"124\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.reddit.com%252fuser%252fFusseel\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=u/Fusseel&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=reddit&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"Reddit\" width=\"130\" height=\"28\"></a> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Fuzs 0212&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"127\" height=\"28\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/askYVd2.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><table style=\"text-align:center\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/config-menus-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/kiHP8s9.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-animations-collection\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/OVV5lXk.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/trading-post\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/UzgNFIB.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pick-up-notifier\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/DCwxKZU.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/console-experience\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/aXWOS7B.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/easy-magic\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Mlxi8cy.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/visual-workbench\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/DTzDrbm.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/diagonal-fences\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/mU9OlhP.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/golden-age-combat\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sHiR309.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/air-hop\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/MinxlVJ.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/askYVd2.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>",
